        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that reads object metadata or head information from a managed object storage service. I will use Amazon S3 as the concrete external provider, as it is a widely used object storage service. The code will use the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with S3. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
