        "text": "<thinking> To create the presigned_download.py file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider to generate a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object. I will use AWS S3 as the provider for this task. The code will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and use it to generate the presigned URL. </thinking>\n",
